{"timestamp": "2026-10-15T23:46:34.389632+00:00", "event": "tool_result", "turn": 7, "name": "read_file", "result": {"path": "README.md", "lines": [{"line": 1, "text": "<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pallets/markupsafe/refs/heads/stable/docs/_static/markupsafe-name.svg\" alt=\"\" height=\"150\"></div>"}, {"line": 2, "text": ""}, {"line": 3, "text": "# MarkupSafe"}, {"line": 4, "text": ""}, {"line": 5, "text": "MarkupSafe implements a text object that escapes characters so it is"}, {"line": 6, "text": "safe to use in HTML and XML. Characters that have special meanings are"}, {"line": 7, "text": "replaced so that they display as the actual characters. This mitigates"}, {"line": 8, "text": "injection attacks, meaning untrusted user input can safely be displayed"}, {"line": 9, "text": "on a page."}, {"line": 10, "text": ""}, {"line": 11, "text": ""}, {"line": 12, "text": "## Examples"}, {"line": 13, "text": ""}, {"line": 14, "text": "```pycon"}, {"line": 15, "text": ">>> from markupsafe import Markup, escape"}, {"line": 16, "text": ""}, {"line": 17, "text": ">>> # escape replaces special characters and wraps in Markup"}, {"line": 18, "text": ">>> escape(\"<script>alert(document.cookie);</script>\")"}, {"line": 19, "text": "Markup('&lt;script&gt;alert(document.cookie);&lt;/script&gt;')"}, {"line": 20, "text": ""}, {"line": 21, "text": ">>> # wrap in Markup to mark text \"safe\" and prevent escaping"}, {"line": 22, "text": ">>> Markup(\"<strong>Hello</strong>\")"}, {"line": 23, "text": "Markup('<strong>hello</strong>')"}, {"line": 24, "text": ""}, {"line": 25, "text": ">>> escape(Markup(\"<strong>Hello</strong>\"))"}, {"line": 26, "text": "Markup('<strong>hello</strong>')"}, {"line": 27, "text": ""}, {"line": 28, "text": ">>> # Markup is a str subclass"}, {"line": 29, "text": ">>> # methods and operators escape their arguments"}, {"line": 30, "text": ">>> template = Markup(\"Hello <em>{name}</em>\")"}, {"line": 31, "text": ">>> template.format(name='\"World\"')"}, {"line": 32, "text": "Markup('Hello <em>&#34;World&#34;</em>')"}, {"line": 33, "text": "```"}, {"line": 34, "text": ""}, {"line": 35, "text": "## Donate"}, {"line": 36, "text": ""}, {"line": 37, "text": "The Pallets organization develops and supports MarkupSafe and other"}, {"line": 38, "text": "popular packages. In order to grow the community of contributors and"}, {"line": 39, "text": "users, and allow the maintainers to devote more time to the projects,"}, {"line": 40, "text": "[please donate today][]."}, {"line": 41, "text": ""}, {"line": 42, "text": "[please donate today]: https://palletsprojects.com/donate"}, {"line": 43, "text": ""}, {"line": 44, "text": "## Contributing"}, {"line": 45, "text": ""}, {"line": 46, "text": "See our [detailed contributing documentation][contrib] for many ways to"}, {"line": 47, "text": "contribute, including reporting issues, requesting features, asking or answering"}, {"line": 48, "text": "questions, and making PRs."}, {"line": 49, "text": ""}, {"line": 50, "text": "[contrib]: https://palletsprojects.com/contributing/"}], "total_lines": 50, "next_line": null, "redactions": []}}
